scn 1
# explore-reveal-2048 (perf follow-up D, timing only): the pooled exploration pass (4096+ units) revealing
# fresh ground every tick on the largest plane. A flat 2048x2048 map (exploration plane 1024x1024 cells),
# nothing explored, four armies of 1200 marching from the corners to the centre: SIMPHASE explore= is the
# workers' reveal and block summaries plus, until D, a rebuild of the summaries from the whole plane every
# tick; since D, the join's exact re-summary of the blocks the workers changed (each once). The pass runs
# pooled only with SimPool workers: set TAK_SIM_WORKERS=1 (or more) on a debug build.
# Run with tools/scenarios/perf-explore/run.sh (base vs candidate on the timing cores).
name explore-reveal-2048
ticks 600
seed 7
players 4
weapons off
explored none
map flat 2048 2048
type r roster
group A 0 r 1200 rect 40 40 200 200
group B 1 r 1200 rect 1848 40 2008 200
group C 2 r 1200 rect 40 1848 200 2008
group D 3 r 1200 rect 1848 1848 2008 2008
at 1 move A 1000 1000
at 1 move B 1048 1000
at 1 move C 1000 1048
at 1 move D 1048 1048
